OL,3,GNEWSAResearch centre aims to pioneer
OL,4,A'responsible AI'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new research centre will address some
OL,7,Fof the challenges in developing AI and
OL,8,Fcement South Yorkshire's involvement in
OL,9,Fthe technology, the people behind it
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,FSheffield Hallam University's Centre of
OL,13,FExcellence in AI and Robotics, which
OL,14,Fwas launched last week, already had
OL,15,Fseveral projects under way focusing on
OL,16,Fethical, inclusive and human-centred
OL,17,Fresearch, according to its director
OL,18,FProf Alessandro Di Nuovo.
OL,20,FDi Nuovo said the overarching message
OL,21,Fof the centre was that "technology
OL,22,Fshould help humans, not replace them".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
